==English==

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|en|fiberglass}} {{qualifier|US}}

===Etymology===
From {{compound|fibre|glass|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|-|es}} {{lb|en|British spelling}}

# [[silica|Silica]] based glass [[extrude]]d into [[fiber]]s that possess a length at least 1000 times greater than their width.
# A [[composite material]] made from [[fine]] [[fibre]]s of [[spun]] [[glass]] held together with [[resin]]. (Also called Glass-Reinforced Plastic.)

